{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105629","id":2472013117,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TV-09","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105629","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105629.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105629.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105629","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105629/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105629/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105629/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6b2674fe18c138764409d4581639faa5490f0aed","number":105629,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Reuse and optimize sorting logic for `List`, `SelfList`, and `HashMap`","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Added `SortList` class, and updated `List`, `SelfList`, and `HashMap` sort methods to use it.  Sorting is done with merge sort, with an initial check to optimize for already sorted lists, and sorted lists that were appended to.\r\n\r\nRemoved `List::sort_custom_inplace`, since `sort_custom` no longer allocates additional memory.\r\n\r\nAdded more sorting tests.\r\n\r\nSpeeds up `ClassDB.get_class_list()` by around 10% when called from GDScript, and speeds up `Dictionary.sort()`, especially for larger unsorted dictionaries, as worst case time complexity is now O(n\\*logn) instead of O(n\\*n).  Compared with GDScript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar shuffled_dictionaries : Array[Dictionary] = []\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\trun_test(\"get_class_list\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sorted_dictionary\")\r\n\trun_test(\"nearly_sorted_dictionary\")\r\n\tgenerate_shuffled_dictionaries(25, 100000)\r\n\trun_test(\"small_shuffled_dictionaries\")\r\n\trun_test(\"large_shuffled_dictionary\")\r\n\t\r\nfunc run_test(p_name : String):\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tcall(p_name)\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%s: %dms\" % [p_name, end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc get_class_list():\r\n\tfor i in 1000:\r\n\t\tClassDB.get_class_list()\r\n\r\nfunc sorted_dictionary():\r\n\tvar dictionary := {}\r\n\tvar keys := range(25).map(str)\r\n\tkeys.sort()\r\n\tfor key in keys:\r\n\t\tdictionary[key] = true\r\n\t\r\n\tfor i in 1000000:\r\n\t\tdictionary.sort()\r\n\r\nfunc nearly_sorted_dictionary():\r\n\tvar dictionary := {}\r\n\tfor i in 25:\r\n\t\tdictionary[i] = true;\r\n\tfor i in 500000:\r\n\t\ti = i % 25\r\n\t\tdictionary.erase(i)\r\n\t\tdictionary[i] = true;\r\n\t\tdictionary.sort()\r\n\r\nfunc generate_shuffled_dictionaries(p_size: int, p_count: int):\r\n\tvar keys := range(p_size).map(str)\r\n\tfor i in p_count:\r\n\t\tkeys.shuffle()\r\n\t\tvar d := {}\r\n\t\tfor j in p_size:\r\n\t\t\td[keys[j]] = true\r\n\t\tshuffled_dictionaries.push_back(d)\r\n\r\nfunc small_shuffled_dictionaries():\r\n\tfor d in shuffled_dictionaries:\r\n\t\td.sort()\r\n\r\nfunc large_shuffled_dictionary():\r\n\tvar keys = range(10000)\r\n\tkeys.shuffle()\r\n\tvar d := {}\r\n\tfor key in keys:\r\n\t\td[key] = true\r\n\td.sort()\r\n```\r\n\r\nold\r\n```\r\nget_class_list: 277ms\r\nsorted_dictionary: 595ms\r\nnearly_sorted_dictionary: 468ms\r\nsmall_shuffled_dictionaries: 434ms\r\nlarge_shuffled_dictionary: 399ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nnew\r\n```\r\nget_class_list: 254ms\r\nsorted_dictionary: 575ms\r\nnearly_sorted_dictionary: 456ms\r\nsmall_shuffled_dictionaries: 342ms\r\nlarge_shuffled_dictionary: 6ms\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":629